  "details": "For the past two updates, several people—including myself—have noticed that parts of our avatars’ outfits, or even entire outfits, disappear at certain viewing angles in first-person view, in mirrors (including the personal mirror and facial mirror), and when using the LilToon shader. As I mentioned, this issue is fairly recent and affects avatars that had never previously experienced the problem, as well as avatars that were recently uploaded or updated. We’ve verified this with several users and tested various “workarounds,” but the avatar still exhibits the problem. This issue is no longer related to user editing; it was introduced with the latest game updates (not beta).\n\nAvatars that use the liltoon shader, recently uploaded with the latest VRChat updates and the latest versions of “VRChat SDK - Base 3.10.5” and “VRChat SDK - Avatars 3.10.5”",
